396
00:35:41.098 --> 00:35:44.476
Every one's a potential nail
to crucify that son of a bitch.

397
00:35:47.062 --> 00:35:48.939
I need to know you're in.

398
00:36:03.453 --> 00:36:06.415
Yeah, let me guess, if I fuck up
